  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41356</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これが
ジャックシードの動力結晶だ。
リチアのスピリアを注入しろ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There's Jackseeds power crystal. Channel Lithia's Spiria into it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43436</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ……ああぁぁ……っ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah... ahhh...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44908</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よし、ジャックシードの
機能が回復したぞ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Alright, Jackseed's back online.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45208</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんだ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45416</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……暴走したリチアの
思念力のせいで伝達回路の
一部が焼き切れたようだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...It appears Lithia's out of power control burnt out one the the transmission circuits.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45416</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>転送システムには
思念力が送りこまれていない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The teleporter is not powered by Will power.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45544</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>壊れかかったスピリアで回路を
焼き切るとは……さすがは
最高ランクの思念術士だな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Burning out a circuit even with a broken Spiria... that's to be expected of a Will mage of that caliber.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45752</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>問題ない。屋上に転送システムと
直結した補助動力結晶がある。
それに思念力を注ぎこめばいい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Not an issue. There is an auxilary power crystal located on the roof which is directly connected to the teleporter. All we must do is channel Will into it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45960</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だが、その前に……
いつまでコソコソ動き回る気だ
インカローズ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But before that... how long do you intent to slink in the shadows, Incarose?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46720</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>クロアセラフと同型のはずだが
オマエはワタシの認識迷彩を
感知できるの……か？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Even though you and Chlorseraph are the same model, you were able to see past my camouflage...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……インカローズ！
よくも僕まで転送空間に
放り出してくれたな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Incarose! You were the one who threw me in the damn teleporter!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>丁度いい……
オマエの思念術機能も剥ぎ取って
僕の機体に装備してやる！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then this is perfect... I'll strip you of your Will features and steal them to myself!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47360</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……無駄だ。
いくら機体を強化しても、お前の
スピリアでは誰にも勝てはしない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...That is futile. No matter how much you augment your body, your Spiria is not strong enough to defeat anyone.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48000</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>リ、リノ……!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>C-Clino...?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48128</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……だが、フローラ様なら
オマエのその弱さすら『優しさ』
だと言ってくださったはずだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...But Master Fluora would say that weakness is your “kindness”.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48632</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>う、うるさい……僕はスピリア
なんか欲しくなかったん……だ！
こんな……怖い気持ちなんて……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>S-shut up... I never wanted this damn Spiria! I hate... this feeling of fear...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48920</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>嫌だ、死にたく……ない……
怖い……怖いよぉ…………
助け……て……フローラ様──</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't... I don't wanna die... I'm so scared... Master Fluora... come save me!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49208</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>安心しろ。
フローラ様は、きっとオマエを
許してくださる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It is alright. I'm sure our Master would forgive you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49208</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オマエを、リチアを……
そしてクリードを殺す
俺と違って……な</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Unlike me who killed you, Lithia... and then Creed.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49416</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>クリード様を殺す……だと？
オマエ如きにできるものか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Did you say... kill Creed? You wouldn't stand a chance against him.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49624</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>可能だ。ロアとオマエの能力を
この体に追加すればな。
ロアと違い、俺には……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It is possible. If I augment my body with both Chlor and your features. I'm not like Chlor, because...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49624</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>恐怖を超える
怒りと憎しみのスピリアが
あるのだからッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I have a Spiria full of rage and hatred that far surpasses my fear!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52284</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふん、出来そこないどもが。
感情などに捕らわれるから
大切な主を守れぬの……だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmph, you're both defective failures. You cannot even fufill your primary directive because you are too caught up in fickle emotions...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52284</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だが、オマエたちの能力は
クリード様のために
使わせてもらう……ぞ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Instead, I shall use your use your features to serve Master Creed...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
